### Working with Insurance & Flexible Options

Insurance coverage can vary widely depending on the specific Medicare Advantage panel, plan tier, and individual therapist credentials within a group practice.

- **In-Network Care:** When a clinician is paneled with your specific Medicare Advantage plan, sessions are billed directly to your insurance, leaving you responsible only for your designated plan copay or deductible.
- **Superbills & Out-of-Network Options:** If a clinician is out-of-network for your particular plan, Riaz Counseling can provide detailed itemized statements (superbills) that you can submit to your insurance carrier for potential out-of-network reimbursement.
- **Self-Pay Options:** For those who prefer to bypass insurance restrictions or prior authorization requirements altogether, transparent self-pay rates are available.

